{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "978a05bce2e8aca2c32c3e85d0d7c1258c71c45b862512133a900ecccd0d8e4f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いま大丈夫ですか？\n相談に乗ってもらいたいことがあって……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您现在有空吗？\n我有件事想找您商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d207fc7da936b501a5c996c252f2227eef7226961147825e7d759b7dedaff906", "ja": "もちろん大丈夫だよ、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "当然没问题，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "d7504512b5cb5c5ba4c97662a132fa37686a39c7725c6088fa442f2be187c70c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　実は、ジュニオールにあげる\nクリスマスプレゼントを考えているんです。", "zh": "谢谢您！其实，我正在考虑送给小朱尼尔的\n圣诞礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "566a90b3b69968ce567770086b5388b0790ca7f0db1d5f6667d6164e3edde05e", "ja": "でも、なかなか決まらなくて……。\nどれがいいか、アドバイスをもらえませんか？", "zh": "可是一直拿不定主意……。\n您能给我一些建议，告诉我选哪个好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e7eb6005bbf7c50882dc859c44962e01b61eea19c4ae050b6307400dcb049e66", "ja": "ああ、わかった。大切な家族への贈り物だし、\n決めるのは大変だよな。", "zh": "啊，我明白了。毕竟是送给重要家人的礼物，\n确实很难决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "9a45927bc7048e474d6a0f0946253019c9c0699afd912c96283ef21e6290ee46", "ja": "そうなんです。ジュニオールが大好きなご飯とか、\n新しいおもちゃとか、いろいろ考えたんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊。我想过朱尼奥尔最喜欢的食物、新玩具之类的各种礼物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "186e28d7247296e75640315981e778b5024d4b5114c94daed09a52ca84e53d3e", "ja": "ジュニオールにも、クリスマスを楽しんでほしくて。\nできれば、今までとは違うものを渡したいんです！", "zh": "我也希望让朱尼奥尔享受圣诞节。\n可以的话，我想送给它一份和以往不一样的礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d3524c547e5934189045e8f320f562fe920576864b68b0eaf564ed8fcc08fdcf", "ja": "違うものか……。\nなら、物じゃないプレゼントを渡すってのはどうだ？", "zh": "不是实物的礼物吗……那送一份不是物品的礼物怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "60a4469349d323a2e7e3c6dac57f2bb12f13695af155d89d8d70d66cd26a7166", "ja": "……物じゃないプレゼント、ですか？", "zh": "……不是物品的礼物，吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3335a8287de3a7c9d94d97119dbdf30e5307d74560613990942f64250230ad22", "ja": "そう。時間とか感情とか、形の見えない物。\n例えば、ジュニオールが好きな時間とか……。", "zh": "对。比如时间、感情这种看不见的东西。\n比如和朱尼奥尔一起度过的快乐时光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "4bde76317d7105a8a7b86863b801ca81db3cf816ac7a708d4158425c3f3c6d45", "ja": "あっ！　それなら、分かります。ジュニオールは、\nわたしたち家族と一緒にいるのが大好きなんですよ！", "zh": "啊！　要是那个的话，我懂的。小修诺尔\n最喜欢跟我们一家人待在一起了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "cfe2cffb1455e8562d8a5f96a65e53b5826314b311d393693ce10f2f6b59d329", "ja": "パパとママ、そしてわたし……。\nみんなでいる時は、いつもうれしそうにしてますから♪", "zh": "爸爸、妈妈，还有我……  \n我们待在一起的时候，它总是看起来很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1012_p", "source_sha256": "29537424e50fe7d58dd821e7b85f397138e3435eb537de93fd810aa19291a1d7", "ja": "はは、そうなんだな。\nじゃあ、もうプレゼントは決まりそうかな？", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。\n那么，礼物差不多已经决定好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "b56294cfac5295c6f5b292e8ae991a6b9f4b870f8eb32cdcf93b4fe06f5d3fa9", "ja": "はい！　家族みんなでお出かけとか……あ、旅行も\nいいですね。ジュニオールとお泊りしてみたいなぁ。", "zh": "是的！一家人一起出门什么的……啊，去旅行也不错呢。我想和朱尼奥尔一起住一晚试试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0573_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "dbeba985b1f63156c1c8c351035f7be94f45b6370186115db99b514c4ed9f143", "ja": "帰ったら、パパとママに相談してみます！\nえへへ、わたしまで楽しみになってきちゃいました♪", "zh": "回去之后，我要去跟爸爸妈妈商量一下！\n诶嘿嘿，连我自己都开始期待起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
